This is a common scenario. Once you get to 8th level you start getting poly
traps. Many players (including myself) level up pets on the traps. In fact the
pets will often deliberatly jump into them.

I found out that Lichs of all types are highly magic resistant. Once you get 
one you really can't poly them anymore. And as a PC you really don't want to
leave a Lich because they go peaceful/feral very very quickly. I guess the
safest place is at Mines End after you clear it out because you probably
will not return there.

In my current game I'm running around with a polyed Arch-Lich that morphed
